# CHG-2036 (approved): host baselines and jobs that apply only where they run (milestone 5.3, decision 2243). The
# imported baselines hold the AWS agents (CloudWatch, SSM): they move to baselines scoped to AWS environments
# (ciamOnProvider aws), so the on-prem lab's servers aren't asked to run them, and the lab's on-prem servers get the
# Red Hat Satellite and Insights clients its site runs. The MRO nightly export reads production only: it applies in
# the production environments (source/prod, and target/prod after the move), not in stage, standby or the lab.
dn: cn=am,ou=baselines,dc=ciam-ops
changetype: modify
delete: ciamHostAgent
ciamHostAgent: amazon-cloudwatch-agent 1.300034.0
ciamHostAgent: amazon-ssm-agent 3.3.40.0
-
replace: ciamChangeRef
ciamChangeRef: cn=CHG-2036,ou=changes,dc=ciam-ops
-

